// Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig (which is gitignored) if you want the
// key baked into the build. Otherwise leave it empty and paste the key into
// NL Lens › Settings, where it is stored in the keychain instead.
//
// Note the escaping: xcconfig treats // as a comment, so a URL or a key
// containing a double slash must be written with the ${SLASH} trick. Plain
// Nebius keys have no slashes, so this is normally a non-issue.
NEBIUS_API_KEY =
